00:09:07.446 --> 00:09:08.748
because as you can tell,

00:09:08.748 --> 00:09:10.116
you know,
there's a lot of

00:09:10.416 --> 00:09:11.417
sympathy for

00:09:11.417 --> 00:09:12.785
for some of these guys, depending

00:09:12.785 --> 00:09:14.520
on where you are in the country.

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:15.388
And again,

00:09:15.388 --> 00:09:16.155
because of the fact

00:09:16.155 --> 00:09:18.124
that they have this past in the U.S.

00:09:18.124 --> 00:09:18.925
military,

00:09:18.925 --> 00:09:19.859
it's often

00:09:19.859 --> 00:09:20.960
a very difficult thing

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:21.294
for them

00:09:21.294 --> 00:09:22.995
to try to infiltrate these groups,

00:09:22.995 --> 00:09:24.297
for them
to try to

00:09:24.397 --> 00:09:27.300
figure out where does the threat lie?

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:27.633
Right.

00:09:27.633 --> 00:09:28.267
A lot of times,

00:09:28.267 --> 00:09:30.102
especially in the last couple of years

00:09:30.102 --> 00:09:31.938
with some of the racial justice

00:09:31.938 --> 00:09:33.773
protests, these guys would show up

00:09:33.773 --> 00:09:36.075
to try to essentially instigate things.

00:09:36.075 --> 00:09:39.412
And so that's one of the difficulties

00:09:39.412 --> 00:09:40.413
here of the

00:09:40.413 --> 00:09:42.481
for the FBI is to try to figure out,

00:09:42.481 --> 00:09:44.584
you know, how to go at these groups

00:09:44.584 --> 00:09:45.785
without violating

00:09:45.785 --> 00:09:47.019
their First Amendment rights.

00:09:47.019 --> 00:09:48.454
You have a right, by the way,

00:09:48.454 --> 00:09:49.555
to say that the U.S.

00:09:49.555 --> 00:09:50.823
government is wrong

00:09:50.823 --> 00:09:51.390
and you have a right

00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:52.625
to protest all of that.

00:09:52.625 --> 00:09:53.893
Where it crosses the line

00:09:53.893 --> 00:09:56.162
is, of course, what these

00:09:56.329 --> 00:09:57.830
these men are accused of doing,

00:09:57.830 --> 00:10:00.132
which is to try to essentially use

00:10:00.633 --> 00:10:03.336
that moment on January six to try to

00:10:03.336 --> 00:10:05.104
block the transfer of power.

